  "sim": {
    "kind": "subckt",
    "name": "INA180A2",
    "text": ".subckt INA180A2 inp inn vp gnd out\n* gain 50; the output cannot go below ~5 mV or above V+ - 0.2 V\nBo o gnd V=limit(50*V(inp,inn),0.005,V(vp,gnd)-0.2)*step(V(vp,gnd)-2.6,0.2)\nRiq vp gnd 12k\nRo o out 5\n.ends INA180A2",
